{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115003","id":3178318461,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc69cUp9","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115003","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115003.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115003.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115003","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115003/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115003/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115003/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5d87e9b616b29c284d18f150bad442dd94ee896e","number":115003,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add support for ASTC 6x6 and high quality compression profiles.","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR adds the ability to compress to ASTC 6x6 as well as have a higher level of control from the image import panel on how the block size for ASTC will be selected. As it stands, the Image API has had a bit of an awkward optional argument here where it lets the user specify the exact ASTC block size, which is not very compatible with Godot's high level and convenient settings.\r\n\r\nThe proposed setting here is to have four compression profiles: max quality, balanced, compressed and max compression. These correspond to ASTC 4x4, a heuristic, ASTC 6x6 and ASTC 8x8 respectively. Balanced will pick one of the three block sizes based on the amount of channels present in the image, which lets Godot automatically pick a bigger block size for textures that are uniform (grayscale) or have very few channels.\r\n\r\nA compatibility method was added for anyone who used the optional argument before, and it maps the 4x4 and 8x8 settings to its corresponding profiles.\r\n\r\n### TODO\r\n- [x] Update compatibility methods with the PR number.\r\n- [x] Documentation.","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":